[h]oardDB> set
Error: PARSE_ERROR: cannot read the statement at character 4: found the end of the statement, expected "extjson", "pager" or "pretty". The form is 'set <setting> [on|off]'. For example 'set pretty on'. Run 'help set' for every form
[h]oardDB> set pretty
pretty is off; 'set pretty on' changes it.
[h]oardDB> set pretty on
pretty is now on for documents printed from now on.
[h]oardDB> set pretty
pretty is on; 'set pretty off' changes it.
[h]oardDB> set extjson
extjson is off; 'set extjson on' changes it.
[h]oardDB> set extjson on
extjson is now on for documents printed from now on.
[h]oardDB> set pager
pager is on; 'set pager off' changes it.
[h]oardDB> set pager off
pager is now off for reports longer than a screen.
[h]oardDB> set pager on
pager is now on for reports longer than a screen.
Paging needs a terminal at both ends, and this session's input is not one: a piped run prints its reports in full.
